 *  - huge `attempt`: `2 ** (attempt - 1)` overflows to `Infinity`, and
 *    `baseDelayMs * Infinity` is `Infinity` (or NaN when base is 0). The cap
 *    always wins here, so we short-circuit before the multiplication.
 */
