  // Once the uncapped exponential would overflow to Infinity, the cap is the
  // (finite) answer. Find the largest attempt whose exponential is finite and
  // still below the cap; beyond that, the cap always wins.
  // baseDelayMs * 2^(attempt-1) <= maxDelayMs  <=>  2^(attempt-1) <= maxDelayMs/baseDelayMs
